(7177763, 1101797, 117534, '<td valign="top">Thank You All! It helped sharing my pain, I wear my feelings on my cuff, when I''m happy (usually all the time) Everyone knows it! It was hard to share pain, much much harder than doing a really goofy ugly photo of myself, which I do often. This was so raw, but I did it.  I want to say I didn''t do it for a sympathy vote, it just seemed like one of the best things I could say about Pooh to show how bad I miss her... Oh tears now.. quit<br/> <br/>Wonderful to find all the fur baby lovers out here!</td>', 'Thank You All! It helped sharing my pain, I wear my feelings on my cuff, when I''m happy (usually all the time) Everyone knows it! It was hard to share pain, much much harder than doing a really goofy ugly photo of myself, which I do often. This was so raw, but I did it.  I want to say I didn''t do it for a sympathy vote, it just seemed like one of the best things I could say about Pooh to show how bad I miss her... Oh tears now.. quit Wonderful to find all the fur baby lovers out here!', '2014-02-17 00:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
