(7178303, 1101933, 161988, '<td valign="top">The red and green lens flare ruins it for me.  Would have been nice with just the sun coming through however it''s never good to have it so over exposed that there are no pixels whatsoever in the center of the sun. Not sure that I lovi this one. However the photographic eye was spot on.  This had great potential. JMHO please don''t take it personally.</td>', 'The red and green lens flare ruins it for me.  Would have been nice with just the sun coming through however it''s never good to have it so over exposed that there are no pixels whatsoever in the center of the sun. Not sure that I lovi this one. However the photographic eye was spot on.  This had great potential. JMHO please don''t take it personally.', '2014-02-18 08:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
