(7178310, 1101302, 161988, '<td valign="top">I chose not to vote as I didn''t want to penalize Mr. Ritz just in case his artistic capabilities are so advanced that it completely flew over my head.  It could be my own lack of vision but I don''t have a clue what you''re trying to impart on us.</td>', 'I chose not to vote as I didn''t want to penalize Mr. Ritz just in case his artistic capabilities are so advanced that it completely flew over my head.  It could be my own lack of vision but I don''t have a clue what you''re trying to impart on us.', '2014-02-18 08:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
