(7178342, 1101933, 124190, '<td valign="top">How can I take anything personally when none of this has anything to do with me?   I was but the vehicle here.    <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>The intensity was intended and inherent to the title in this shot, sent to me to receive and share as a gift.  :-))) This one was as it was supposed to be, unaltered, honest and real, not to be toned down. <br/> <br/>Always and never are two words you should always remember never to use.<br/> <br/>I welcome all comments and criticisms and thank you for them.</td>', 'How can I take anything personally when none of this has anything to do with me?   I was but the vehicle here.       The intensity was intended and inherent to the title in this shot, sent to me to receive and share as a gift.  :-))) This one was as it was supposed to be, unaltered, honest and real, not to be toned down.  Always and never are two words you should always remember never to use. I welcome all comments and criticisms and thank you for them.', '2014-02-18 10:32:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7178364, 1101410, 19825, '<td valign="top">I love this portrait -- that sweet, innocent face and the falling snow. This finished much higher in my ranking -- sorry I did not let you know that during voting.</td>', 'I love this portrait -- that sweet, innocent face and the falling snow. This finished much higher in my ranking -- sorry I did not let you know that during voting.', '2014-02-18 11:23:41.000000', NULL, 0),
