(7179070, 1101797, 59029, '<td valign="top">Oh Katie, I am so sorry.  Wish I''d looked through the entries so I''d known what you were going through.  Belated hugs and headbumps of love from me, Lily, Galena and Druli in spirit</td>', 'Oh Katie, I am so sorry.  Wish I''d looked through the entries so I''d known what you were going through.  Belated hugs and headbumps of love from me, Lily, Galena and Druli in spirit', '2014-02-19 18:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
